103
00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:28.940
Tanner, Bertrand: And so I'm not going to talk today at all about the super relaxed state, although there is starting to become a whole different regulatory pathway along the thick filament that's been known about for a while, and there's a lot of study on this, and it's called the super-relaxed state, where the traditional calcium activation along the thin filament

104
00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:46.020
Tanner, Bertrand: But there's something that might be, based on a force-sensitive or mechanotransduction regulatory pathway that augments these cross bridges laying down on the thick filament backbone versus popping up to be able to be involved with cross-bridge binding.

