00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:49.579
Tanner, Bertrand: Here in green, you've shown, as you stretch out the sarcomere, at some point, you'll start to, even in the absence of any activation, you'll start to get an increase in the muscle force.

112
00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:56.699
