00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:18.060
Tanner, Bertrand: On the left, and on the right, it's the descending limb of the force-length relationship. And if you add those together, you get a total force.

115
00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:31.749
Tanner, Bertrand: And in the back of my mind, I've been working over, sort of, the last decade wondering if this force-length relationship and what leads to force production is purely due to thin filament overlap, or if there might be some additional contributions that change

