144
00:28:41.710 --> 00:28:51.339
Tanner, Bertrand: And so, the raw data looks something like this, where there's the elastic modulus on top, the viscous modulus on the bottom, and those are plotted against frequency.

145
00:28:51.470 --> 00:29:00.379
Tanner, Bertrand: And so this is a log scale for the frequency, just to let you know. And the sarcomere length 2.2 microns, and sarcomere length 1.

