00:29:29.130 --> 00:29:45.349
Tanner, Bertrand: the model shown there in the top right corner that has to do with this A process that has to do with some of the passive characteristics of the tissue, and then this B and this C process have to do with cross-bridge dynamics, or cross-bridge cycling kinetics.

