00:33:02.200 --> 00:33:18.009
Tanner, Bertrand: And so, I think one of the reasons this is, and this is sort of delving very much into the details of the biophysics, but I think the reason this might be happening is that as you're trying to go through that power stroke, or that cross bridge stroke.

